{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01TRYw3Ca61ofaqNyN3E1Wag","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Anchor is a single-user, local-first productivity and R&D mission-control system. Grounded from the project's own docs (`CLAUDE.md`, North Star anchors):\n\n- **What it is:** A personal productivity system for J.C. Liechty, living entirely in `C:\\dev\\Anchor` (single folder, no syncing). Plain-text markdown files are the source of truth â€” no database, no binary formats.\n\n- **Core app it ships:** `anchor_gui.py` â€” a self-contained Python **stdlib-only** HTTP server (one declared native exception: optional `pywinpty` for terminals) that renders a browser dashboard at `http://localhost:8777`, runs persistently as the NSSM Windows service `anchor`, and reads/writes the markdown files directly via a local API. A CLI mirror (`anchor.py`) provides the same task logic plus static `dashboard.html` generation.\n\n- **Task management:** Tracks tasks through a lifecycle (active â†’ done â†’ cancelled â†’ saved-for-later â†’ restored) across domain files (academic, commercial, family, writing), with a quick-capture inbox, priorities/energy/due-dates, and per-task notes.\n\n- **R&D \"Project Cockpit\" (its biggest subsystem):** Turns each project's window into a calm single-screen cockpit for **trio-driven R&D** â€” the researchPrime â†’ Crucible â†’ Foreman skill chain. Each lane (Research/Planning/Build/Deliverables/Grass) is a tile with one honest status light; clicking expands an inline panel with a cached summary on top and a real, resizable **ConPTY terminal** (xterm.js over WebSocket) below. Launching a session feels like a normal Claude Code / Gemini session â€” the lane's skill auto-loads once, greets once.\n\n- **Supporting R&D machinery it ships:** per-session git-worktree isolation, a durable session registry, proactive cached project/session summaries (generate-twice + grounding filter), stage handoffs, engine toggle (Claudeâ†”Gemini), per-lane doc-role maps, cost/tokens/time rollups, grass-idea promotion, and type-aware deliverable launching (skill/tool/service/program/doc).\n\n- **Self-verification:** A daily 5:00 AM health check (`anchor_healthcheck.py`) parses every markdown file, boots a throwaway server, and walks the v2/v3/v4 R&D surfaces fully stubbed (never touching the live `:8777` service or real data), writing dated reports.\n\n- **Branding:** Presented as a Ghost World Labs tool \"powered by NextGen Nuclear â˜¢.\"\n\nThe system has shipped four R&D surface versions (v2, v3, v4 all built and merged to master); the current branch `foreman/rnd-v4.1-cockpit` is iterating on the v4 cockpit rendering."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4310,"cache_creation_input_tokens":24733,"cache_read_input_tokens":20597,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":24733},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"20683469-d0c8-4807-ba37-953babbabba3","uuid":"dafbdbe7-5894-4020-be7d-9b1114329910","request_id":"req_011Cc2F6xCb5bYs8MQiYHFsM"}
